WEBVTT

00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:04.564
Open the agent and select Call

00:00:04.564 --> 00:00:08.501
Cap how often one person is called

00:00:08.501 --> 00:00:12.425
Set the maximum call duration

00:00:12.425 --> 00:00:19.710
Set when the agent checks in and hangs up

00:00:19.710 --> 00:00:23.587
Set the calling window

00:00:23.587 --> 00:00:26.233
Turn on voicemail options

00:00:26.233 --> 00:00:35.464
Replace the summary with your own message

00:00:35.464 --> 00:00:38.043
Choose the interruption sensitivity

00:00:38.043 --> 00:00:44.202
Add background audio and a graceful exit

00:00:44.202 --> 00:00:47.205
Chat sessions have their own limits

00:00:47.205 --> 00:00:49.510
Each change saves as soon as you make it
